Bind Npc 26051 Zone 1

On greeting
    If quest 220 is started and player has 910050000
        Say "I'm the Catcher of Keys, the guardian of the first key! You are qualified to answer the question since you possess the [Written Order of Seven Keys]. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "What kind of power does Cypher have?"
            Topic "Power that makes everything vanish" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910050000
                    Give 1 of 910051000
            Topic "Power that creates everything" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910050000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Written Order of Seven Keys] has been consumed as penalty. I will leave now in search of the secret of the keys."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 220 is started
        Say "I'm the Catcher of Keys, the guardian of the first key! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Written Order of Seven Keys]."
    Else
        Say ""
